<title>USA: Nitches authorizes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Nitches authorizes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nitches Inc said Monday its board of directors has authorized a limited repurchase of common stock.</p>
<p>It did not specify how many shares would be acquired but said the timing and volume of any buybacks would depend on &quot;management's ongoing assessment of the company's working capital requirements and liquidity.&quot;</p>
<p>Nitches said that under an agreement with a financial institution, it is required to maintain $9 million of net worth and $8.5 million of working capital.</p>
</text>
